      "title": "START HERE",
      "properties": {},
      "widgets_values": [
        "## MOSS SFT with two LoRA slots\nEdit the prompt and Run. The INT8 diffusion model and small VAE reduce memory use.\n\nSlot 1 applies the small SFT Destripe LoRA at strength 1.5, following its author's 1024 px guidance. It targets color banding.\n\nSlot 2 starts at 0 (off). Place a compatible MOSS SFT adapter in models/loras, refresh, choose it here, and follow its recommended strength and trigger words. Both slots modify only the diffusion model. Turbo adapters can require different sampling settings.\n\nImages save to output/moss/fast/.\n\nAdapter: https://huggingface.co/nynxz/MOSS-Image"
      ],
      "widgets_values_named": {
        "text": "## MOSS SFT with two LoRA slots\nEdit the prompt and Run. The INT8 diffusion model and small VAE reduce memory use.\n\nSlot 1 applies the small SFT Destripe LoRA at strength 1.5, following its author's 1024 px guidance. It targets color banding.\n\nSlot 2 starts at 0 (off). Place a compatible MOSS SFT adapter in models/loras, refresh, choose it here, and follow its recommended strength and trigger words. Both slots modify only the diffusion model. Turbo adapters can require different sampling settings.\n\nImages save to output/moss/fast/.\n\nAdapter: https://huggingface.co/nynxz/MOSS-Image"
      },
      "color": "#254438",
      "bgcolor": "#232936"
